{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, הֵיכַל","hw":"הֵיכַל","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">הֵיכַל</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m. palace, temple (</strong>Assyrian loan-word; BH; also Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">היכלא</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">הכלא</span> Lzb <sup>259</sup> SAC <sup>43</sup><strong>)</strong>;—emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵיכְלָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:14\" href=\"/Ezra.4.14\">Ezr 4:14</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵיכַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:26\" href=\"/Daniel.4.26\">Dn 4:26</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵיכְלִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:1\" href=\"/Daniel.4.1\">4:1</a>, -<span dir=\"rtl\">לֵהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:19\" href=\"/Daniel.6.19\">6:19</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>palace</em> of king <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:1\" href=\"/Daniel.4.1\">Dn 4:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:26\" href=\"/Daniel.4.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:5\" href=\"/Daniel.5.5\">5:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:19\" href=\"/Daniel.6.19\">6:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 4:14\" href=\"/Ezra.4.14\">Ezr 4:14</a> (v. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, מְלַח²\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_מְלַח²\", dir=\"rtl\">מְלַח</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>temple:</em> <strong>a.</strong>  in Jerusalem <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:2\" href=\"/Daniel.5.2\">Dn 5:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:3\" href=\"/Daniel.5.3\">3</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:14\" href=\"/Ezra.5.14\">Ezr 5:14a</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:15\" href=\"/Ezra.5.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:5\" href=\"/Ezra.6.5\">6:5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>. <strong>b.</strong>  in Babylon <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:14\" href=\"/Ezra.5.14\">5:14b</a>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">הַיְתִי</span> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, אֲתָה\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_אֲתָה\">אֲתָא</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, הֲלַךְ","prev":"BDB Aramaic, הוּא"}